{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1994","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Fun Game"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vova really loves the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bitwise_operation#XOR"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"XOR"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" operation (denoted as $$$\\oplus$$$). Recently, when he was going to sleep, he came up with a fun game."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"At the beginning of the game, Vova chooses two binary sequences $$$s$$$ and $$$t$$$ of length $$$n$$$ and gives them to Vanya. A binary sequence is a sequence consisting only of the numbers $$$0$$$ and $$$1$$$. Vanya can choose integers $$$l, r$$$ such that $$$1 \\leq l \\leq r \\leq n$$$, and for all $$$l \\leq i \\leq r$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"simultaneously"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" replace $$$s_i$$$ with $$$s_i \\oplus s_{i - l + 1}$$$, where $$$s_i$$$ is the $$$i$$$-th element of the sequence $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In order for the game to be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"interesting"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", there must be a possibility to win. Vanya wins if, with an "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"unlimited"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" number of actions, he can obtain the sequence $$$t$$$ from the sequence $$$s$$$. Determine if the game will be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"interesting"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" for the sequences $$$s$$$ and $$$t$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test consists of multiple test cases. The first line contains an integer $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le q \\le 10^{4}$$$) — the number of test cases. Then follows the description of the test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the length of the sequences $$$s$$$ and $$$t$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains a binary sequence $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line of each test case contains a binary sequence $$$t$$$ of length $$$n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" if the game will be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"interesting"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", otherwise output \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"No"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You can output each letter in any case (for example, the strings \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yEs"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" will be recognized as a positive answer)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n1\n0\n1\n7\n0110100\n0110100\n9\n100101010\n101111110\n4\n0011\n1011\n4\n0100\n0001\n8\n10110111\n01100000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nNO\nYES\nYES\nNO\nYES\nYES\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, Vanya will not be able to change the sequence $$$s$$$ with the only possible action of choosing $$$l = r = 1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, the sequences $$$s$$$ and $$$t$$$ are already equal."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third test case, Vanya can act as follows:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Choose $$$l = 3$$$ and $$$r = 5$$$, then $$$s$$$ will become $$$\\mathtt{101101010}$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Choose $$$l = 5$$$ and $$$r = 6$$$, then $$$s$$$ will become $$$\\mathtt{101111010}$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Choose $$$l = 7$$$ and $$$r = 7$$$, then $$$s$$$ will become $$$\\mathtt{101111110}$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1994B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1994/problem/B"}